# GIANI plugin configuration (ImageJ/Fiji)
#
# Registers the GIANI macro extension, exposing its functions to ImageJ macros:
#   loadPropertiesFile, setProperty, getPropertyList, run
# (invoked as Ext.GIANI.<function> from a macro).
#
# The Swing GUI (net.calm.giani.ui.GIANIUI) is launched from
# net.calm.giani.exec.GIANI's main() method (run the JAR with no arguments),
# not from this file.
Extensions, "GIANI", net.calm.giani.macro.GIANIMacroExecutor
